{"log": {"at": "2026-08-16T15:40:00-05:00", "msg": "TRAP: a tab driven through MCP eval is document.visibilityState=hidden, and a hidden tab runs no rendering steps — rAF never fires and ResizeObserver never delivers. The layout-space ruler kept all five shots at max-content 4184px and every one scored B 84. Cost ~30 min chasing a layout bug that was a measurement bug. Recorded in ruler.js and in the claim-tab skill; use mcp shot or headless Playwright for geometry."}}
{"log": {"at": "2026-08-16T15:42:00-05:00", "msg": "Calibration run (26 good pages + 10 library/bad traps, 1280 and 3440) refit six of the eleven bands. repetition was written at 0.30-0.75 from intuition and the site measures 0.23 (p10-p90 0.09-0.42); measure narrowed to the sites own IQR 52-68; pad-share is the tightest quantity measured (median 0.037, IQR 0.033-0.047, width-independent) and gained weight; frame-gap is BIMODAL (chrome ~0.4-0.8, cards ~1.6-1.9, median in the empty middle) and lost weight; lanes is partly a page-chrome artefact (the bad/ traps score higher than the good pages); depth is root-relative AND bimodal so it weights last. A weight is evidence, not opinion."}}
