{"log": {"at": "2026-08-16T17:20:00-05:00", "msg": "Fourth rater correction, found by the taste page rating itself: scale counted DISTINCT gap values and this tiers own doc page measured 25, scoring zero. Any real page has a long tail of one-off gaps (a table border, a caption, an icon beside a word) on top of the three or four sizes it is genuinely built from. It counts the VOCABULARY now — the smallest set of values covering four fifths of the pages gaps. Presets now read scale 2-4 and the Hunt page rates itself B 80 where the taste page rated F 59."}}
